OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy in
OL,6,Fthe far south at first, but skies
OL,7,Fgradually clearing. Clear skies for
OL,8,Fmany and turning chilly with fog
OL,9,Fforming in eastern England. Turning
OL,10,Fcloudier in Scotland and Northern
OL,11,FIreland with outbreaks of rain and
OL,12,Fbrisk winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FAfter a chilly, locally foggy
OL,15,Fstart, much of England and Wales
OL,16,Fenjoys warm sunny spells. Further
OL,17,Fnorth, cloud, rain and fresh winds
OL,18,Fspread across the north.
